A49. Where Glenna Collett got her start. ~ TEE
A50. This kind of a car is very popular. ~ NEW
A51. This is what the cat brought back. ~ KITTENS
A54. A social climber. ~ APE
A55. The way the lights were turned. ~ ON
A56. These are always flighty. ~ GEESE
A57. This is one of the best sellers. ~ AD
A58. Toward. ~ TO
A60. A much puzzled man. (On account of his short name.) ~ AL
A61. To be brief, this is great. ~ GT
