D2. This is always hanging around the kitchen. ~ PAN
D3. To expiate. ~ ATONE
D4. A progressive word. ~ GO
D5. Business people take this right after breakfast. ~ EL
D6. This is drunk at night and crusty in the morning. ~ TOAST
D7. This is a duty to your government. ~ TAX
